{"ref":"passive:metaglio-left","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Metaglio Left is a passive item in Vampire Survivors. It is unlocked after obtaining ",{"t":"Yellow Sign","r":"relic:yellow-sign"},". It cannot be found via level ups, and must be found as a stage item."]},{"k":"p","c":["Metaglio Left increases ",{"i":"Sprite-Recovery.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:recovery"}," ",{"t":"Recovery","r":"powerup:recovery"}," by 0.1 and multiplies ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"}," by 1.05 per level."]},{"k":"p","c":["Metaglio Left, alongside ",{"i":"Sprite-Metaglio_Right.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:metaglio-right"}," ",{"t":"Metaglio Right","r":"passive:metaglio-right"},", is required for the evolution of ",{"i":"Sprite-Laurel.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:laurel"}," ",{"t":"Laurel","r":"weapon:laurel"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Crimson_Shroud.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:crimson-shroud"}," ",{"t":"Crimson Shroud","r":"weapon:crimson-shroud"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Metaglio Left cannot be obtained from level ups, but can be found as a stage item in every stage, except ",{"t":"Bat Country","r":"stage:bat-country"},", ",{"t":"Tiny Bridge","r":"stage:tiny-bridge"},", and Eudaimonia Machine. Generally, it will spawn west of the starting area. It will always be guarded by a City Atlantean."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Passive item","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["23 May 2022 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["LEFT"]]},{"label":"Player stat","cells":[[{"t":"Recovery","r":"powerup:recovery"},", ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"}]]},{"label":"Rarity","cells":[["10"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["9"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[["+0.1, +5%"]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[["Additive, Multiplicative"]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[["+0.8, +47.7%"]]},{"label":"Stage item","cells":[["Most Stages"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"levels","title":"Levels","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Metaglio Left has 9 levels. Each of them multiplies the current value of ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"}," by 1.05. At max level, Metaglio Left provides +0.8 ",{"t":"Recovery","r":"powerup:recovery"},"."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Level"],"h":1},{"c":["Description"],"h":1},{"c":["Effect total"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 1"]},{"c":["Channels dark powers to protect the bearer."]},{"c":["-"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 2"]},{"c":["Health recovery increases by 0.1 HP/s. Max Health increases by 5%."]},{"c":["0.1 Recovery, 1.05x Max Health"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 3"]},{"c":["Health recovery increases by 0.1 HP/s. Max Health increases by 5%."]},{"c":["0.2 Recovery, 1.1025x Max Health"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 4"]},{"c":["Health recovery increases by 0.1 HP/s. Max Health increases by 5%."]},{"c":["0.3 Recovery, 1.157625x Max Health"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 5"]},{"c":["Health recovery increases by 0.1 HP/s. Max Health increases by 5%."]},{"c":["0.4 Recovery, 1.21550625x Max Health"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 6"]},{"c":["Health recovery increases by 0.1 HP/s. Max Health increases by 5%."]},{"c":["0.5 Recovery, 1.2762815625x Max Health"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 7"]},{"c":["Health recovery increases by 0.1 HP/s. Max Health increases by 5%."]},{"c":["0.6 Recovery, 1.340095640625x Max Health"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 8"]},{"c":["Health recovery increases by 0.1 HP/s. Max Health increases by 5%."]},{"c":["0.7 Recovery, 1.40710042265625x Max Health"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 9"]},{"c":["Health recovery increases by 0.1 HP/s. Max Health increases by 5%."]},{"c":["0.8 Recovery, 1.4774554437890625x Max Health"]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"evolutions","title":"Evolutions","blocks":[{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Base weapon"],"h":1},{"c":[],"h":1},{"c":["Passive item"],"h":1},{"c":[],"h":1},{"c":["Evolution"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Laurel.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:laurel"},"\n",{"t":"Laurel","r":"weapon:laurel"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":["Max level:\n",{"i":"Sprite-Metaglio_Left.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"passive:metaglio-left"},"\nMetaglio Left+",{"i":"Sprite-Metaglio_Right.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"passive:metaglio-right"},"\n",{"t":"Metaglio Right","r":"passive:metaglio-right"}]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Crimson_Shroud.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:crimson-shroud"},"\n",{"t":"Crimson Shroud","r":"weapon:crimson-shroud"}]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Metaglio Left does not provide any stats at level 1."]},{"c":["The player can equip the ",{"i":"Sprite-Penshin_Fatcha.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:penshin-fatcha"}," ",{"t":"Penshin Fatcha","r":"weapon:penshin-fatcha"}," and then evolve it once to get the ",{"i":"Sprite-Vacuum.png","w":24,"h":24}," Lavatrix Machina. When the player touches the Lavatrix Machina, it can attract the Gold Ring while skipping the need to fight the ",{"i":"Sprite-City_Atlantean.png","w":14,"h":18}," City Atlantean."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 17 August 2023 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fixed Metaglio merging not showing in equipment panel."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 23 May 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Metaglio Left, ",{"i":"Sprite-Metaglio_Right.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:metaglio-right"}," ",{"t":"Metaglio Right","r":"passive:metaglio-right"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Silver_Ring.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:silver-ring"}," ",{"t":"Silver Ring","r":"passive:silver-ring"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Ring.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:gold-ring"}," ",{"t":"Gold Ring","r":"passive:gold-ring"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Torrona's_Box.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:torrona-s-box"}," ",{"t":"Torrona's Box","r":"passive:torrona-s-box"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Outer_Saboteur.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:outer-saboteur"}," ",{"t":"Outer Saboteur","r":"passive:outer-saboteur"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-AnteChamber.png","w":10,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ante Chamber DLC to access"}," are the only passive items with max level 9 instead of the usual 5."]},{"c":["When both Metaglio Left and Metaglio Right are obtained, they move to the first two slots of the passive weapons and form a cross-shape on a wand."]},{"c":["Metaglio is a portmanteau of the Italian words \"metà\" meaning \"half\" and \"taglio\" meaning \"cut\", literally \"cut in half\". This word first appeared in a sketch by the comedian Maccio Capatonda."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}